    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to represent the sale of 7 Ardlea Road, Artane to the market, a well maintained three bedroom family home set in a highly sought after mature residential location with convenient access and garage space to the rear. \n\nThe light filled accommodation is briefly comprised of connecting reception rooms offering living and dining area and kitchen. Upstairs, there are three good sized bedrooms and the main family bathroom. The front garden offers off street car parking. The rear garden is well kept and low maintance and further features a block shed/ garage space that opens out to a convenient laneway. \n\n7 Ardlea road is located beside a host of amenities such as local shops, schools, churches, Artane Castle S.C. and Beaumount Hospital. Situated adjacent to the Artane Roundabout on the Malahide Road with excellent transport links on the doorstep giving direct and easy access to the City Centre. \n\nTo be truly appreciated viewing comes highly recommended."
      },
